Usage: vifstab format [flags...] [operands...]

Print aligned fstab; writing requires --in-place.

Subcommands:
    help  Print this help message
    usage Print this usage message


Flags:
    --file string         (default: "/etc/fstab")   Input file; an explicit path
                                                    takes precedence over piped
                                                    stdin. Use - for stdin.
    --in-place, -i        (default: false)          Replace the selected file
                                                    using the save and recovery
                                                    workflow.
    --backup-dir string   (default: "")             RCS directory for in-place
                                                    formatting.

Positional Arguments:
    [operands...] No positional operands are accepted.
